## Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
|---------|-------|-----|
| No **Marketplace** item in nav | missing `marketplace:manage` permission | sign in as Platform Administrator |
| Deploy 401/403 "not pullable" | bad PAT or image not yet published | green CI run + correct `read:packages` PAT |
| `ERR_TOO_MANY_REDIRECTS` on tenant URL | KC_PUBLIC_URL empty on operator | see `05-multitenant-mesh-notes.md` |
| Redirect loop after login (SSO mode) | wrong realm — `marketplace-backend` points at `ai-trust` but your tenant uses a different realm | see `05-multitenant-mesh-notes.md` |
| App loads but body is empty | frontend fetches root-absolute `/api/…` — escapes the embed prefix | make the frontend prefix-aware (see `08-worked-example-weather-app.md §8.4`) |
| Tile not in sidebar | not enabled for your role, or not `running` | Step 3; confirm status is `running` |

Full background: `marketplace/Implementation/` (end-to-end onboarding guide).
